    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Please submit all feature requests and bug reports relating to the Digital Design System or the Frontend Kit directly to the digital expert team via Jira. You can learn more about how the process works, here ."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If you have any feedback or questions about designing digital touchpoints, feel free to send them to support.design@bosch.com . We’re also happy to check design drafts."
    },
